                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJF2DZ87arQjQR-bBHd6PFEUQ/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKaE1IQjRiMmxqYkVWR2FtOVJUR3B5UjBWUVFrRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "4 months ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I\u0027d only ever passed by before, but today I finally mustered the courage to try it.\n\nThe reviews said it was the best healthy meal box I\u0027d ever had, especially the laksa chicken, which was very popular, so I asked if they had any left.\n\nI was surprised to find I managed to get the last one! The cauliflower was flavorful, not bland like boiled vegetables. I only disliked the bok choy.\n\nI really liked that the rice wasn\u0027t purple rice but quinoa. Overall, the taste was delicious; the reviews weren\u0027t lying.\n\nIt truly is the best meal box I\u0027ve ever had. I usually only give 4 stars to good ones, but this deserves 5 stars.\n\nI\u0027ll definitely buy it again.\n\n\n(January 29, 2026: Bought ginger-braised pork. The cauliflower had a bitter taste; I\u0027m not sure if it was a seasoning issue or if it wasn\u0027t fresh. So I\u0027m changing the rating to 4 stars (I won\u0027t want to eat there again because of this taste).)",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "之前都只是經過，今天鼓起勇氣嘗試。\n看評論說是吃過最好吃的健康餐盒，尤其是叻沙雞很搶手，就問問看還有沒有，\n沒想到最後一份被我買到了~\n花椰菜有入味不會像水煮沒味道，除了油菜不太愛；\n然後米不是紫米是藜麥飯這點我很喜歡，而且整體味道好吃，評論沒騙人，\n真的是目前吃到最好吃的餐盒，平常覺得不錯的也只給4星，但這味道值得給5⭐。\n之後會再去買\n\n2026.1.29買薑汁燒肉，花椰菜入口有種苦味，不清楚是調味問題，還是不新鮮。所以改4顆星（會因為這味道不想再去吃）",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
