                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I used to like his lunchboxes because they had a lot of fresh vegetables as side dishes, but I was very disappointed today when I bought the mackerel and Italian vegetarian dishes. The side dishes even had a lot of Taiwanese pickled bamboo shoots! (These are from two lunchboxes) I\u0027m completely disappointed and will never buy from him again!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "之前因為餐點配菜多為各式新鮮蔬菜而喜歡他的餐盒，但今天買了鯖魚和義式蔬食卻大失所望，配菜竟然有大量台式酸筍！（這是兩個餐盒拿出來的）徹底失望，以後不會再買了！",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
