                                     "text":  "Sea Bass and Teriyaki Chicken Combo\nThe sea bass was so fresh! The chicken was so tender!\nThe quinoa rice was healthy and delicious! The side dishes were also fresh and tasty: cauliflower, cabbage, baby corn, shredded green beans, and a soft-boiled egg.\nHealthy, delicious, affordable, and amazing!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "鱸魚照燒雞雙拼\n鱸魚好新鮮 雞肉好嫩\n藜麥飯健康美味\n配菜也新鮮好吃：花椰菜、白菜、玉米筍、豆絲、溏心蛋\n健康美味平價超讚",
